[
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Day ten.",
"start": 0.0,
"end": 0.94
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "The ground shakes.",
"start": 1.1,
"end": 2.238
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Dirt pours from the ceiling of your tunnel.",
"start": 2.47,
"end": 5.036
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Outside, the sky is on fire.",
"start": 5.698,
"end": 7.939
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "And at the door, something too big to fit inside is breathing.",
"start": 8.298,
"end": 13.453
},
{
"chunk": 2,
"text": "Ten days ago, you were asleep in your own bed.",
"start": 15.403,
"end": 18.7
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You have 10 days before the asteroid that killed the dinosaurs.",
"start": 19.251,
"end": 22.85
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "Every big animal you see will die.",
"start": 23.512,
"end": 25.938
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You won't.",
"start": 26.101,
"end": 26.867
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "If you stay small.",
"start": 27.645,
"end": 28.818
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The night before was like any other.",
"start": 30.117,
"end": 32.311
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "Homework, a documentary about the dinosaurs, your phone at 23%.",
"start": 32.787,
"end": 37.826
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "\"I'll charge it in the morning.\"",
"start": 38.232,
"end": 39.765
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "In your backpack, ready for school: two textbooks, a sandwich, two chocolate bars, half a bottle of water.",
"start": 40.125,
"end": 47.485
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "And a library book you wanted to read in the break tomorrow.",
"start": 48.066,
"end": 50.933
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The Last Day of the Dinosaurs.",
"start": 51.351,
"end": 53.94
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "In the morning, there's no ceiling.",
"start": 54.491,
"end": 56.453
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "There are leaves, each one bigger than your bed.",
"start": 56.72,
"end": 59.646
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The air is hot and wet.",
"start": 60.064,
"end": 61.666
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No cars.",
"start": 61.782,
"end": 62.49
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No voices.",
"start": 62.56,
"end": 63.512
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "Next to you, something rises from the ground like a tree trunk.",
"start": 64.174,
"end": 67.402
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It isn't a tree.",
"start": 68.439,
"end": 69.554
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It has claws.",
"start": 70.336,
"end": 71.462
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The foot lifts, slams down one step ahead, and the ground jumps under you.",
"start": 71.776,
"end": 77.755
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "You don't breathe until the footsteps fade.",
"start": 78.243,
"end": 81.551
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your backpack is lying next to you.",
"start": 82.101,
"end": 84.191
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your phone is still in your pocket.",
"start": 84.504,
"end": 86.42
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No signal.",
"start": 87.082,
"end": 87.964
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No internet.",
"start": 88.127,
"end": 89.044
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Just one message that wasn't there last night.",
"start": 89.16,
"end": 91.993
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "\"Impact: 10 days.",
"start": 92.654,
"end": 94.419
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "3,000 kilometers south.\"",
"start": 94.582,
"end": 96.428
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A prank.",
"start": 96.588,
"end": 97.354
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A dream.",
"start": 97.516,
"end": 98.294
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "It has to be.",
"start": 98.341,
"end": 99.328
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "You switch it off at 22%, and you start walking.",
"start": 99.908,
"end": 103.426
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "All afternoon, you look for a road, a wire, a plane in the sky.",
"start": 103.975,
"end": 108.34
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Anything.",
"start": 108.503,
"end": 109.269
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "There's nothing.",
"start": 109.429,
"end": 110.335
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "In the evening, you find the owner of the foot.",
"start": 111.241,
"end": 113.655
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "A T.",
"start": 113.818,
"end": 114.247
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 114.294,
"end": 114.863
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "12 meters, nose to tail, with a long pale scar across its snout.",
"start": 115.35,
"end": 120.168
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "For one second, its head turns toward you.",
"start": 120.83,
"end": 123.465
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Then it walks on.",
"start": 123.698,
"end": 125.311
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 126.767,
"end": 128.044
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "That night you squeeze in between the roots of a giant tree.",
"start": 128.595,
"end": 132.124
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You're shaking.",
"start": 132.322,
"end": 133.274
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't want to sleep.",
"start": 133.332,
"end": 134.539
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "In the dark, you open your backpack, looking for anything that makes sense.",
"start": 135.12,
"end": 139.833
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "The library book.",
"start": 140.321,
"end": 141.563
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the cover, a T.",
"start": 141.981,
"end": 143.572
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "rex skeleton in a museum.",
"start": 143.607,
"end": 145.545
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't look closely.",
"start": 145.731,
"end": 147.217
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Inside, chapter seven.",
"start": 147.879,
"end": 149.725
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Who Survived.",
"start": 149.885,
"end": 150.907
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that were small.",
"start": 151.487,
"end": 152.927
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that hid underground.",
"start": 153.345,
"end": 155.051
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that lived near fresh water.",
"start": 155.539,
"end": 157.791
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the back page, with your school pen, you write a plan.",
"start": 158.372,
"end": 161.645
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Three things.",
"start": 162.307,
"end": 163.12
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Ten days.",
"start": 163.28,
"end": 164.058
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "None of them done.",
"start": 164.371,
"end": 165.358
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't decide to fall asleep.",
"start": 165.776,
"end": 167.46
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Your body decides for you.",
"start": 167.692,
"end": 170.142
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "In the morning, there's a small hole by the roots.",
"start": 171.442,
"end": 174.228
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "A furry face pokes out.",
"start": 174.391,
"end": 176.202
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 176.864,
"end": 177.804
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Sniffs.",
"start": 177.944,
"end": 178.605
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Disappears.",
"start": 178.803,
"end": 179.697
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "You name him Pip.",
"start": 180.358,
"end": 182.402
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 182.952,
"end": 183.37
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "rex needs mountains of meat every day.",
"start": 183.428,
"end": 185.68
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Pip needs a few seeds and a hole to hide in.",
"start": 186.168,
"end": 188.757
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "And your book agrees.",
"start": 189.419,
"end": 190.916
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Scientists think that after the impact, almost no land animal heavier than about 25 kilograms survived.",
"start": 191.578,
"end": 198.648
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "You weigh 70.",
"start": 199.686,
"end": 201.242
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "So you'll have to think like Pip.",
"start": 201.509,
"end": 203.262
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Rule one: stay small.",
"start": 203.842,
"end": 206.489
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat half the sandwich.",
"start": 207.04,
"end": 208.665
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You save the rest.",
"start": 208.723,
"end": 209.873
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Then you watch what Pip eats.",
"start": 210.36,
"end": 212.404
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Small red berries, seeds from one kind of fern.",
"start": 212.984,
"end": 216.119
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "That's no guarantee.",
"start": 216.537,
"end": 217.756
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Plenty of things a mouse can eat would kill you.",
"start": 217.849,
"end": 220.066
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "But he's a mammal, like you, and the sandwich won't last.",
"start": 220.647,
"end": 224.049
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat one berry.",
"start": 224.629,
"end": 225.767
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You wait.",
"start": 225.813,
"end": 226.463
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "By evening, nothing has happened.",
"start": 226.881,
"end": 228.809
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You fill your pockets.",
"start": 229.296,
"end": 231.049
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Day three.",
"start": 231.899,
"end": 232.828
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "The bottle is empty.",
"start": 233.095,
"end": 234.267
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Your throat is burning.",
"start": 234.337,
"end": 235.649
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "You follow the sound of water to a wide, muddy river.",
"start": 236.311,
"end": 239.921
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "At the edge, a log is floating.",
"start": 240.409,
"end": 242.464
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It blinks.",
"start": 243.595,
"end": 244.43
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It isn't a log.",
"start": 245.468,
"end": 246.513
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It's a crocodile.",
"start": 246.571,
"end": 248.417
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "So you don't drink from the river.",
"start": 248.967,
"end": 250.708
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "A few steps back from the bank, in the sand, you dig a pit and wait.",
"start": 251.289,
"end": 255.759
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Water seeps in through the sand.",
"start": 256.177,
"end": 258.185
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 258.766,
"end": 259.451
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Muddy.",
"start": 259.611,
"end": 260.354
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "But cleaner than the river, and far from the teeth.",
"start": 260.772,
"end": 263.651
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You fill the bottle.",
"start": 264.139,
"end": 265.335
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "In the shallow pools, small fish are trapped.",
"start": 265.753,
"end": 268.771
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You catch three and dry them on a hot rock.",
"start": 269.259,
"end": 271.871
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "No fire needed.",
"start": 272.452,
"end": 273.682
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "It's warm here, almost tropical, even at night.",
"start": 274.263,
"end": 277.188
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "From now on, every morning starts at the pools.",
"start": 277.966,
"end": 280.707
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "The book says freshwater animals, turtles, frogs, even crocodiles, made it through far better than most.",
"start": 280.869,
"end": 287.057
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Rule two: stay near water.",
"start": 287.638,
"end": 290.61
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Day four.",
"start": 291.91,
"end": 292.816
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The ground shakes again.",
"start": 293.477,
"end": 294.894
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Not one footstep.",
"start": 294.987,
"end": 296.229
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Hundreds.",
"start": 296.391,
"end": 297.053
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A herd of duck-billed dinosaurs comes along the river.",
"start": 297.413,
"end": 300.989
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Then a deep sound rolls in from far away.",
"start": 301.755,
"end": 304.426
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You feel it in your chest more than your ears.",
"start": 304.913,
"end": 307.583
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The herd panics.",
"start": 308.164,
"end": 309.546
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Trees snap.",
"start": 309.685,
"end": 310.753
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You throw yourself behind a fallen log.",
"start": 311.113,
"end": 313.47
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "When the dust settles, one of them didn't get up.",
"start": 314.132,
"end": 316.395
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "And it has something you need.",
"start": 316.813,
"end": 318.265
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A shoulder blade.",
"start": 318.323,
"end": 319.251
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Flat.",
"start": 319.31,
"end": 319.762
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Wide.",
"start": 319.832,
"end": 320.412
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The size of a paddle.",
"start": 320.529,
"end": 321.759
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "From today, your shovel is a dinosaur.",
"start": 322.537,
"end": 325.347
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Day five.",
"start": 326.196,
"end": 327.113
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "You read the page you've been avoiding.",
"start": 327.775,
"end": 329.598
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Within an hour of the impact, burning debris falls back through the sky, all over the world.",
"start": 330.016,
"end": 336.285
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Scientists still argue about how hot it got.",
"start": 336.866,
"end": 340.058
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "In many places, hot enough to set forests on fire.",
"start": 340.476,
"end": 343.762
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "On the surface, there's nowhere to hide.",
"start": 344.342,
"end": 346.513
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Under a meter of soil, maybe.",
"start": 347.291,
"end": 349.091
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Rule three: stay underground.",
"start": 349.869,
"end": 353.085
},
{
"chunk": 16,
"text": "You find a clay bank above the river and start digging.",
"start": 353.635,
"end": 357.257
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "Now the math.",
"start": 357.807,
"end": 359.014
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "With a bone, in clay, a cave big enough to crouch in grows about 30 centimeters a day.",
"start": 359.676,
"end": 366.12
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "To get a meter of soil over your head, you have to go two and a half meters in.",
"start": 366.538,
"end": 370.845
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "That's eight days of work.",
"start": 371.333,
"end": 373.028
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "The asteroid hits on day ten.",
"start": 373.69,
"end": 375.617
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "You have five.",
"start": 376.198,
"end": 377.451
},
{
"chunk": 18,
"text": "You dig until it's too dark to see, then sleep in the mud by the hole.",
"start": 378.001,
"end": 383.852
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Day six.",
"start": 384.703,
"end": 385.574
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Your hands are blistered.",
"start": 385.841,
"end": 387.257
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You're in as deep as your arms can reach.",
"start": 387.675,
"end": 389.858
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Then the roof comes down on you.",
"start": 390.895,
"end": 393.101
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You crawl out coughing dirt.",
"start": 393.519,
"end": 395.481
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Everything you dug, gone.",
"start": 396.612,
"end": 398.388
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Four days left.",
"start": 398.62,
"end": 399.793
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Eight days of digging.",
"start": 400.281,
"end": 401.732
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You sit in the mud.",
"start": 402.282,
"end": 403.408
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And there, in the bank next to your ruin, a tiny new hole.",
"start": 403.629,
"end": 407.901
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip followed you to the river.",
"start": 409.09,
"end": 410.854
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "His hole is tiny.",
"start": 411.04,
"end": 412.596
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And it doesn't collapse.",
"start": 413.165,
"end": 414.384
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Because Pip doesn't dig a cave.",
"start": 414.953,
"end": 416.741
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip digs a tunnel exactly as wide as Pip, and one small nest at the end.",
"start": 417.612,
"end": 422.685
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "So you stop digging a cave.",
"start": 423.103,
"end": 425.089
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You dig a tunnel exactly as wide as your shoulders.",
"start": 425.75,
"end": 428.571
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "A quarter of the dirt.",
"start": 428.989,
"end": 430.51
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Four times as fast.",
"start": 430.65,
"end": 432.113
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And you shape the roof into an arch, because an arch pushes the weight into the walls instead of down on you.",
"start": 432.6,
"end": 439.288
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "The entrance faces north, away from where the asteroid will hit.",
"start": 440.193,
"end": 444.86
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Maybe it makes no difference.",
"start": 445.766,
"end": 447.206
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "It feels right.",
"start": 447.24,
"end": 448.274
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 448.434,
"end": 449.317
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Even when you dig.",
"start": 449.479,
"end": 451.465
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "By dark, the tunnel swallows you to the waist.",
"start": 452.014,
"end": 454.731
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "That night you sleep with your head underground and your boots outside.",
"start": 455.393,
"end": 458.992
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "It's a start.",
"start": 459.154,
"end": 460.605
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Day seven.",
"start": 461.906,
"end": 462.788
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Pip doesn't run anymore.",
"start": 463.694,
"end": 465.226
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "He's waiting at the entrance in the morning.",
"start": 465.493,
"end": 467.479
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "You split your last chocolate with him, and you dig.",
"start": 467.897,
"end": 470.939
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "By noon, the blisters have burst.",
"start": 471.357,
"end": 473.667
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Your palms are raw and bleeding into the clay.",
"start": 474.085,
"end": 476.952
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "And you know a hand that breaks today digs nothing tomorrow.",
"start": 477.37,
"end": 480.366
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "So you stop.",
"start": 480.783,
"end": 481.643
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even with three days left.",
"start": 482.223,
"end": 483.64
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even if the end is coming anyway.",
"start": 484.301,
"end": 486.229
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "For one afternoon, you rest.",
"start": 486.321,
"end": 488.934
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 489.484,
"end": 490.703
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Just for a minute.",
"start": 490.796,
"end": 491.69
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "The minute becomes an hour.",
"start": 491.957,
"end": 493.431
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Photos.",
"start": 493.629,
"end": 494.291
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your room.",
"start": 494.451,
"end": 495.229
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your mom in the kitchen.",
"start": 495.542,
"end": 496.785
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends outside school.",
"start": 496.901,
"end": 498.851
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Then a video, from a few months ago.",
"start": 499.432,
"end": 501.568
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "A class trip to a museum.",
"start": 501.603,
"end": 503.24
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You, laughing at the camera, a giant skeleton behind you.",
"start": 503.728,
"end": 507.861
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "\"If they ever sent me back to the dinosaurs?",
"start": 508.349,
"end": 511.03
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "I'd survive.",
"start": 511.228,
"end": 512.238
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Easy.\"",
"start": 512.398,
"end": 513.211
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends laughing behind the phone.",
"start": 513.989,
"end": 517.03
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Why are you here?",
"start": 518.98,
"end": 520.095
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "What happened?",
"start": 520.129,
"end": 521.256
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe you're still asleep.",
"start": 521.569,
"end": 522.997
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe this is all a dream.",
"start": 523.64,
"end": 525.405
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "You look down at your hands.",
"start": 525.892,
"end": 527.645
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "The pain is real.",
"start": 528.776,
"end": 530.018
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 530.603,
"end": 531.868
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "You always said you'd survive.",
"start": 533.818,
"end": 535.768
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Now you have to prove it.",
"start": 536.899,
"end": 538.095
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "When you switch it off, it's at 11%.",
"start": 538.873,
"end": 541.137
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Ten percent, gone on home.",
"start": 541.206,
"end": 543.087
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "It was worth it.",
"start": 543.753,
"end": 545.413
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "That night, you fit all the way inside.",
"start": 545.963,
"end": 548.564
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "You wake up, and Pip is asleep in your jacket pocket.",
"start": 549.214,
"end": 552.418
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Warm.",
"start": 553.312,
"end": 554.009
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Breathing.",
"start": 554.169,
"end": 554.866
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Seven days in a world with no one.",
"start": 555.504,
"end": 558.105
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "And now you have someone.",
"start": 559.41,
"end": 561.917
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Day eight.",
"start": 563.218,
"end": 563.903
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "You dig until your arms shake.",
"start": 563.996,
"end": 565.993
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Two and a half meters.",
"start": 566.48,
"end": 567.758
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "And at the very end, a nest, just big enough to sit up in.",
"start": 568.117,
"end": 572.053
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "A meter of soil over your head.",
"start": 572.471,
"end": 574.364
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "That night, for the first time in eight days, nothing can step on you.",
"start": 575.025,
"end": 580.168
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "At midnight, you wake.",
"start": 582.118,
"end": 583.523
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Scratching at the entrance.",
"start": 583.941,
"end": 585.427
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then sniffing.",
"start": 585.543,
"end": 586.623
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then something coming in.",
"start": 587.041,
"end": 588.643
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "In the dark, two yellow eyes.",
"start": 589.305,
"end": 591.429
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "A feathered hunter.",
"start": 591.545,
"end": 592.637
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Fast.",
"start": 592.834,
"end": 593.519
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Only as tall as your knee.",
"start": 593.6,
"end": 595.179
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Not a T.",
"start": 595.667,
"end": 596.213
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 596.271,
"end": 596.759
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small enough to fit in your tunnel.",
"start": 596.84,
"end": 598.523
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small doesn't mean safe.",
"start": 599.185,
"end": 600.927
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Your headlamp lights it up.",
"start": 601.477,
"end": 602.998
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It doesn't care.",
"start": 603.114,
"end": 604.182
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It lunges.",
"start": 604.848,
"end": 605.789
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Claws rip across your right forearm.",
"start": 606.149,
"end": 608.529
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No knife.",
"start": 609.109,
"end": 609.771
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No fire.",
"start": 609.933,
"end": 610.723
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No room to swing a bone.",
"start": 610.839,
"end": 612.302
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Just one thing this world has never seen.",
"start": 613.339,
"end": 615.685
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 616.265,
"end": 617.484
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "11%.",
"start": 617.507,
"end": 618.436
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You hit the alarm and point the flashlight straight into its face.",
"start": 618.494,
"end": 621.965
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "A sound sixty-six million years too early fills the tunnel.",
"start": 622.627,
"end": 626.83
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It shrieks, and it's gone.",
"start": 627.798,
"end": 629.69
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "But it could come back.",
"start": 630.24,
"end": 631.889
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Blood drips from your arm.",
"start": 632.794,
"end": 634.512
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Pip creeps out of your pocket and sits by your hand.",
"start": 634.93,
"end": 637.891
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "You can't leave the light on.",
"start": 638.379,
"end": 639.83
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "It would be dead in an hour, and dawn is five hours away.",
"start": 639.946,
"end": 643.672
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "So you count.",
"start": 643.835,
"end": 645.031
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Ten seconds of light.",
"start": 645.809,
"end": 647.237
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "One minute of dark.",
"start": 647.655,
"end": 648.862
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Every time the dark comes back, you listen for claws.",
"start": 649.524,
"end": 653.692
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "When the sky turns grey, you switch it off.",
"start": 655.642,
"end": 658.057
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "3%.",
"start": 659.385,
"end": 660.279
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Day nine.",
"start": 661.129,
"end": 661.977
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You have a fever.",
"start": 662.069,
"end": 663.056
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The wound is hot.",
"start": 663.172,
"end": 664.275
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You wrap it in a strip torn from your t-shirt.",
"start": 664.693,
"end": 667.364
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The entrance let a hunter in.",
"start": 667.944,
"end": 669.802
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Tomorrow, it has to keep the whole world out.",
"start": 670.22,
"end": 672.925
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "One-handed, you drag stones up from the river and stack them around the opening.",
"start": 673.586,
"end": 677.952
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Last, a big flat stone.",
"start": 678.439,
"end": 680.32
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "From inside, you can drag it across like a door, and push it aside to get out.",
"start": 681.098,
"end": 685.602
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "When it's closed, it leaves a gap a hand wide.",
"start": 686.508,
"end": 689.55
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Enough for air.",
"start": 690.212,
"end": 691.256
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Not enough for teeth.",
"start": 691.315,
"end": 692.545
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The sun is going down when the door slides into place.",
"start": 693.207,
"end": 696.284
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Just in time.",
"start": 696.771,
"end": 697.77
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Two out of three.",
"start": 698.002,
"end": 699.058
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Twelve dried fish won't last a winter.",
"start": 699.546,
"end": 701.938
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "And you're out of days.",
"start": 702.031,
"end": 704.271
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch the phone on one more time.",
"start": 705.572,
"end": 708.01
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "The message has changed.",
"start": 708.324,
"end": 709.798
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "\"Impact: tomorrow.\"",
"start": 710.46,
"end": 712.132
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch it off.",
"start": 712.55,
"end": 714.256
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "That night you slide the door aside and climb out.",
"start": 714.806,
"end": 717.65
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The sky is full of stars.",
"start": 718.01,
"end": 719.822
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "From across the river comes that low, familiar call.",
"start": 720.402,
"end": 723.722
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The same T.",
"start": 724.21,
"end": 725.267
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 725.313,
"end": 725.963
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The last night of the dinosaurs.",
"start": 726.277,
"end": 728.134
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "And only you know.",
"start": 728.483,
"end": 730.735
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "It isn't a strange morning.",
"start": 731.285,
"end": 732.98
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "That's what makes it strange.",
"start": 733.561,
"end": 735.232
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Birds are singing.",
"start": 735.592,
"end": 736.765
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Insects are buzzing.",
"start": 736.925,
"end": 738.353
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "A few triceratops are drinking across the river.",
"start": 738.933,
"end": 741.894
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "None of them know.",
"start": 742.672,
"end": 744.506
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Then, in the south, a light.",
"start": 745.056,
"end": 747.471
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Not like the sun.",
"start": 748.133,
"end": 749.131
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Like someone switched the sky on by mistake.",
"start": 750.262,
"end": 753.733
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Your book said the shaking comes within minutes.",
"start": 754.283,
"end": 757.139
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It's right.",
"start": 758.27,
"end": 758.989
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The ground starts to move.",
"start": 759.895,
"end": 761.555
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Not like a footstep.",
"start": 761.973,
"end": 763.262
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Like the whole world.",
"start": 763.378,
"end": 764.539
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The river pulls back.",
"start": 764.771,
"end": 766.28
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Then it comes back, the wrong way.",
"start": 766.397,
"end": 768.998
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "A wall of water runs upstream and throws fish onto the bank.",
"start": 769.416,
"end": 773.119
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It climbs up the bank, and stops a hand below your door.",
"start": 773.607,
"end": 777.38
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "When it pulls back, you run down and grab every fish you can carry.",
"start": 777.868,
"end": 781.931
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Food for the dark.",
"start": 782.969,
"end": 784.06
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The last thing on your list.",
"start": 784.13,
"end": 785.975
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The end of the world just handed it to you.",
"start": 786.637,
"end": 788.994
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "This isn't imagination.",
"start": 789.482,
"end": 791.316
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "In North Dakota, scientists found fossil fish with tiny glass beads from this impact stuck in their gills.",
"start": 791.804,
"end": 799.826
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Then those same glass beads start falling from the sky.",
"start": 800.376,
"end": 803.836
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Small and hot, like burning hail.",
"start": 804.741,
"end": 807.551
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "The sky turns red.",
"start": 807.783,
"end": 809.327
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "You drag the door shut, hold Pip tight and crawl to the end of the tunnel.",
"start": 809.908,
"end": 814.192
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Outside, the first trees catch fire.",
"start": 814.773,
"end": 817.791
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "By evening, the whole forest is burning.",
"start": 818.372,
"end": 821.274
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "And then, outside, footsteps.",
"start": 821.824,
"end": 824.297
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Heavy.",
"start": 824.854,
"end": 825.481
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 825.667,
"end": 826.398
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Close.",
"start": 826.558,
"end": 827.173
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Something huge collapses at your door, and its shadow covers the gap.",
"start": 827.928,
"end": 832.015
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 832.572,
"end": 833.002
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 833.06,
"end": 833.594
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "From day one.",
"start": 833.754,
"end": 834.695
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The scar across its snout.",
"start": 834.788,
"end": 836.448
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its huge snout is right against the stones.",
"start": 837.087,
"end": 839.629
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its hot breath fills your tunnel.",
"start": 839.745,
"end": 841.893
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It can't get in.",
"start": 842.803,
"end": 843.813
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It doesn't even try.",
"start": 844.08,
"end": 845.218
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It only came for the cool soil at your door, away from the fire.",
"start": 845.357,
"end": 850.001
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "All night, from the other side of the stones, you hear it breathing.",
"start": 850.551,
"end": 854.591
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "Each breath slower.",
"start": 855.253,
"end": 857.703
},
{
"chunk": 46,
"text": "Until morning.",
"start": 859.653,
"end": 861.278
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "Then it stops.",
"start": 863.228,
"end": 864.435
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "The last dinosaur you saw died at your door.",
"start": 865.566,
"end": 869.165
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "In the days after, the river rises again and buries the T.",
"start": 870.465,
"end": 874.436
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "rex in thick mud.",
"start": 874.47,
"end": 875.922
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "Buried fast in mud.",
"start": 876.34,
"end": 878.035
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "That's how bones become fossils.",
"start": 878.522,
"end": 880.496
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "You open your book to the cover.",
"start": 880.914,
"end": 882.528
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "The museum skeleton.",
"start": 882.667,
"end": 884.072
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "And this time, you look closely.",
"start": 884.235,
"end": 886.173
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "A long scar, healed into the bone of the snout.",
"start": 887.385,
"end": 891.681
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The same skeleton that stood behind you in that video.",
"start": 893.631,
"end": 896.754
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The one you joked in front of.",
"start": 897.021,
"end": 898.681
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "Sixty-six million years from now, it will stand in a museum.",
"start": 899.262,
"end": 902.907
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "And one day, you'll stand in front of it, laughing, with no idea you were here when it died.",
"start": 903.395,
"end": 909.606
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Then the dark comes.",
"start": 910.156,
"end": 911.839
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Soot from fires all over the world, and dust from the impact, cover the whole sky.",
"start": 912.327,
"end": 918.19
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Sunlight can't get through.",
"start": 918.608,
"end": 920.117
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Plants can't grow.",
"start": 920.35,
"end": 921.847
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And it gets cold.",
"start": 922.265,
"end": 923.391
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Scientists think this impact winter lasted months.",
"start": 924.297,
"end": 927.304
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Maybe years.",
"start": 927.617,
"end": 928.546
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "The world gave you one gift on its last day.",
"start": 929.022,
"end": 931.878
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Fire.",
"start": 932.458,
"end": 933.097
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You carried an ember in from the burning forest.",
"start": 933.41,
"end": 935.802
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You keep a small fire right at the gap, never deep inside.",
"start": 936.29,
"end": 940.191
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "In a closed tunnel, smoke kills quietly.",
"start": 940.667,
"end": 944.115
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And at night, Pip sleeps against your neck.",
"start": 944.684,
"end": 947.412
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Two small bodies, keeping each other warm.",
"start": 947.9,
"end": 951.023
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "The phone won't turn on anymore.",
"start": 951.573,
"end": 953.384
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "So you scratch lines on the tunnel wall with a sharp stone.",
"start": 953.57,
"end": 956.496
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Inventory.",
"start": 957.111,
"end": 958.005
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Days after the end: 40.",
"start": 958.086,
"end": 959.804
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Still dark.",
"start": 959.909,
"end": 960.71
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dried fish: 7.",
"start": 960.87,
"end": 962.344
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Running low.",
"start": 962.46,
"end": 963.204
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero.",
"start": 964.299,
"end": 966.192
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Friends: one.",
"start": 966.352,
"end": 967.386
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 967.49,
"end": 968.372
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "You repeat the rules to yourself.",
"start": 968.923,
"end": 970.85
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 971.512,
"end": 972.545
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay near water.",
"start": 972.705,
"end": 973.831
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay underground.",
"start": 973.991,
"end": 975.164
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "And a new one, that no book ever taught you.",
"start": 975.941,
"end": 978.681
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small…",
"start": 979.587,
"end": 980.585
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "but don't stay alone.",
"start": 980.818,
"end": 982.977
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Small animals like Pip made it out of this darkness.",
"start": 983.527,
"end": 986.673
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Millions of years later, from small mammals like him, came horses, whales, apes.",
"start": 987.161,
"end": 993.604
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "And people.",
"start": 993.767,
"end": 994.754
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Sixty-six million years later, one of Pip's great-great-great-grandchildren is watching this video.",
"start": 995.114,
"end": 1001.453
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "And just then, from outside the tunnel, a sound.",
"start": 1002.003,
"end": 1005.022
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "A bird, singing.",
"start": 1006.152,
"end": 1007.545
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "You cross out a line on the wall, and write it again.",
"start": 1007.905,
"end": 1010.529
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero…",
"start": 1011.857,
"end": 1014.074
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "except the birds.",
"start": 1014.237,
"end": 1016.013
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "On day one, what would you have done first?",
"start": 1016.563,
"end": 1019.582
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "Tell me in the comments.",
"start": 1020.359,
"end": 1021.753
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "And if you want to know what you and Pip did after the dark, tell me that too.",
"start": 1022.333,
"end": 1027.012
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 1027.562,
"end": 1028.363
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay alive.",
"start": 1028.421,
"end": 1029.512
}
]